    "detailed_description": "<strong>Let the gates open...</strong><br><br>Arkell is the embodiment of an open-world RPG, filled with nostalgic gameplay and bursts of enjoyment. It is a single-player exploration into a world of unknowns, a world filled with monsters and devils waiting to strike at any wrong move. Here, we have a balanced amalgamation of action, adventure, and tons of fun.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An intense adventure into a world dotted with mountains, rivers, and fields alike<br></li><li> High-quality graphics entwined with nostalgic elements to manufacture a truly unique experience<br></li><li> Fun and easy combat with realistic enemies and monsters<br></li><li> Ambient sounds as backgrounds to create an utterly immersive experience<br></li><li> Interactions with NPCs to advance the gameplay and story<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959620/extras/42253f86efa665215f71af73f25d7e20.poster.avif?t=1674827358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959620/extras/42253f86efa665215f71af73f25d7e20.webm?t=1674827358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959620/extras/42253f86efa665215f71af73f25d7e20.mp4?t=1674827358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
